 "description": "<p>Halloween devil costumes usually fail on the wings; this one builds the set around them. Black leather top, attached wings, and a matching panty piece, with an open-chest cut that keeps the outfit in costume-lingerie territory.</p>\n<p>The wings are structured enough to hold their shape through a night, which is the difference between a devil and a person wearing black. The leather top closes at the front and leaves the chest open below the collar line.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Includes: top, wings, panties</li>\n<li>Style: Halloween little devil</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fits 40-60 kg. Add horns from any shop and the look is complete - the wings here are the piece worth showing up for.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Black little devil costume with leather top, structured wings and panties, open-chest cut, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
